  "prefLabel": "Ed 509.04 Late Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 509.04 Late Filing.\n\n(a) A renewal application shall be considered a late filing if it is received by the department after June 30 of the year of its expiration.\n\n(b) A late filing shall be accepted by the department if the applicant meets renewal requirements and files:\n\n(1) The appropriate lapsed license reinstatement fee as enumerated in Ed 505.09; and\n\n(2) The appropriate licensure renewal fee pursuant to Ed 505.09.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; amd by #3198, eff 2-21-86; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED :6-25-96\n\nNew. #6349, eff 10-5-96; ss by #7923, eff 7-24-03; ss by #8229, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10362, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13103, eff 10-5-20; ss by #14263, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
